#: usr/share/caramos-ota/driver-check/caramos_driver_check/ui/attachments.py:86
msgid ""
"Screen recording: press Ctrl+Shift+Alt+R to start and again to stop; the "
"video is attached by itself."
msgstr ""
"Quay màn hình: bấm Ctrl+Shift+Alt+R để bắt đầu, bấm lần nữa để dừng; video "
"sẽ tự được đính kèm."

#: usr/share/caramos-ota/driver-check/caramos_driver_check/ui/attachments.py:88
msgid ""
"Up to 5 files, videos up to 1 minute. They are made smaller before sending, "
"without the place and time photos and videos keep. When you let the "
"community see the request, they are published with it once VNLF has reviewed "
"them."
